{"id":"c7624782e2090b42","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-singular-cardinal.md","title":"Singular Cardinal","display":"df-singular-cardinal — Singular Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-singular-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-singular-cardinal"],"display":"df-singular-cardinal — Singular Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-singular-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-singular-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-singular-cardinal — Singular Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (cardinal candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\)</span> (cofinality function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SingularCardinal}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\operatorname{SingularCardinal}(\\kappa)\\)</span> (singular-cardinal predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}singular\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash \\operatorname{SingularCardinal}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)&lt;\\kappa\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}singular\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash \\operatorname{SingularCardinal}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)&lt;\\kappa\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0, \\aleph_1, \\aleph_2, \\ldots\">\\(\\aleph_0, \\aleph_1, \\aleph_2, \\ldots\\)</span> are regular for successor cardinals.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_\\omega\">\\(\\aleph_\\omega\\)</span> is singular with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}(\\aleph_\\omega) = \\omega\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}(\\aleph_\\omega) = \\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)$ (cofinality function, see [[58-df-cofinality]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SingularCardinal}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}singular\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash \\operatorname{SingularCardinal}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)<\\kappa","display":true},{"tex":"\\aleph_0, \\aleph_1, \\aleph_2, \\ldots","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}(\\aleph_\\omega) = \\omega","display":false}],"bytes":955,"backlinks":[{"id":"40699403f178dfd3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Singular}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-singular-cardinal]])"},{"id":"70f838ca7c11b06f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SingularCardinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch20/58-df-singular-cardinal.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1175","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-singular-cardinal.md|58-df-singular-cardinal]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","315ad00b8744fdfc"]}